{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"pest-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Pest Snippets","description":"Pest tests: test, it, describe, datasets, expectations, HTTP and JSON feature tests, acting as a user, fakes, Livewire and architecture tests.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"PHP","path":"snippets/php.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/php.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ptest\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"test('${1:it works}', function () {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A test\"\n  },\n  \"it\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pit\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"it('${1:does something}', function () {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An it test\"\n  },\n  \"describe\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pdesc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"describe('${1:Feature}', function () {\",\n      \"    it('${2:works}', function () {\",\n      \"        $0\",\n      \"    });\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A group of tests\"\n  },\n  \"beforeEach\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pbefore\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"beforeEach(function () {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Run before each test\"\n  },\n  \"dataset\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pdata\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"it('${1:validates}', function (\\\\$${2:value}) {\",\n      \"    $0\",\n      \"})->with([${3:'a', 'b'}]);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A test with a dataset\"\n  },\n  \"expect toBe\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pexp\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"expect(\\\\$${1:value})->toBe(${2:true});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An expectation\"\n  },\n  \"expect chain\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pexpc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"expect(\\\\$${1:value})\",\n      \"    ->toBeString()\",\n      \"    ->not->toBeEmpty();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Chained expectations\"\n  },\n  \"expect toThrow\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pthrow\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"expect(fn () => ${1:doSomething()})->toThrow(${2:Exception}::class, '${3:message}');\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Expect an exception\"\n  },\n  \"HTTP get\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pget\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"it('shows ${1:the page}', function () {\",\n      \"    \\\\$this->get('${2:/}')\",\n      \"        ->assertOk()\",\n      \"        ->assertSee('${3:Welcome}');\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A feature test for a page\"\n  },\n  \"HTTP post\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ppost\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"it('${1:stores a record}', function () {\",\n      \"    \\\\$response = \\\\$this->post('${2:/posts}', [\",\n      \"        '${3:title}' => '${4:A title}',\",\n      \"    ]);\",\n      \"\",\n      \"    \\\\$response->assertRedirect();\",\n      \"    \\\\$this->assertDatabaseHas('${5:posts}', ['${3:title}' => '${4:A title}']);\",\n      \"});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A feature test for a form\"\n  },\n  \"Acting as\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pact\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\$user = User::factory()->create();\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\\\\$this->actingAs(\\\\$user)->get('${1:/dashboard}')->assertOk();\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Test as a signed in user\"\n  },\n  \"Validation error\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pvalid\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\$this->post('${1:/posts}', [])->assertSessionHasErrors(['${2:title}']);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Test a validation error\"\n  },\n  \"JSON api\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pjson\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"\\\\$this->getJson('${1:/api/posts}')\",\n      \"    ->assertOk()\",\n      \"    ->assertJsonStructure(['data' => [['${2:id}']]]);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Test a JSON endpoint\"\n  },\n  \"Database refresh\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"prefresh\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"uses(Illuminate\\\\\\\\Foundation\\\\\\\\Testing\\\\\\\\RefreshDatabase::class);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Reset the database for each test\"\n  },\n  \"Fake\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pfake\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Mail::fake();\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\",\n      \"\",\n      \"Mail::assertSent(${1:OrderShipped}::class);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Fake a facade\"\n  },\n  \"Livewire test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"plw\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Livewire::test(${1:Counter}::class)\",\n      \"    ->set('${2:count}', ${3:5})\",\n      \"    ->call('${4:increment}')\",\n      \"    ->assertSet('${2:count}', ${5:6});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Test a Livewire component\"\n  },\n  \"arch test\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"parch\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"arch('${1:controllers do not use the DB facade}')\",\n      \"    ->expect('App\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Http\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Controllers')\",\n      \"    ->not->toUse('Illuminate\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Support\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Facades\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\DB');\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An architecture test\"\n  },\n  \"skip\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pskip\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"it('${1:name}')->skip('${2:not ready}');\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Skip a test\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Pest Snippets\n\nPest tests: test, it, describe, datasets, expectations, HTTP and JSON feature tests, acting as a user, fakes, Livewire and architecture tests.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 18 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| PHP | `ptest` | A test |\n| PHP | `pit` | An it test |\n| PHP | `pdesc` | A group of tests |\n| PHP | `pbefore` | Run before each test |\n| PHP | `pdata` | A test with a dataset |\n| PHP | `pexp` | An expectation |\n| PHP | `pexpc` | Chained expectations |\n| PHP | `pthrow` | Expect an exception |\n| PHP | `pget` | A feature test for a page |\n| PHP | `ppost` | A feature test for a form |\n| PHP | `pact` | Test as a signed in user |\n| PHP | `pvalid` | Test a validation error |\n| PHP | `pjson` | Test a JSON endpoint |\n| PHP | `prefresh` | Reset the database for each test |\n| PHP | `pfake` | Fake a facade |\n| PHP | `plw` | Test a Livewire component |\n| PHP | `parch` | An architecture test |\n| PHP | `pskip` | Skip a test |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}